# Keep secrets and junk out of the build context.
#
# The .env exclusion is the important one: without it, `docker build` copies
# relayer/.env — your hot wallet private key and deposit wallet mnemonic — into
# an image layer, where it stays forever even if a later layer deletes it. Anyone
# who can pull the image can extract both keys.
relayer/.env
relayer/.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*

.git
.gitignore
node_modules
artifacts
cache
*.log

# Docs and contracts are not needed to build the Go binaries.
*.md
ledger/
contracts/
scripts/
test/
